				"subject_definitions:\n<Subject 1<Picture 1>> is the yellow ox character on the left side of , with a soft, fuzzy yellow body suit, small silver horns, droopy eyes, and cow ears.\n<Subject 2<Picture 2>> is the cartoon piglet character in the middle of , wearing a bright red-and-gold festive jumpsuit with a pig-eared hood.\n<Subject 3<Picture 3>> is the pear-shaped yellow mascot on the right side of , with large green eyes, a cream-colored belly, and thin yellow limbs.\n<Subject 4> is a rectangular white hand-held placard displaying the bold black text \"minimax牛逼\".\n\nsummary:\n[reference generation] The 7-second, 3:4 aspect ratio video features <Subject 1>, <Subject 2>, and <Subject 3> from performing an energetic and flamboyant runway fashion walk, with <Subject 1> confidently holding up <Subject 4>.\n\nretention_analysis:\n(character blueprints): weak_reference - used as a style and model sheet to reconstruct the three main characters.\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - the fuzzy yellow ox character's features, horns, and calm expression are retained.\n<Subject 2> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - the cartoon piglet's festive red-and-gold jumpsuit and cute appearance are retained.\n<Subject 3> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - the pear-shaped yellow mascot's smooth texture, green eyes, and thin limbs are retained.\n\ndetailed_description:\nThe target video has a vibrant, high-energy fashion show style in a 3:4 aspect ratio, featuring bright stage spotlights and a polished dark wood runway.\n[Shot 1] A continuous medium-wide camera tracks backward smoothly, keeping all three characters in frame as they strut down the catwalk. In the center, <Subject 1> walks with an exaggerated, sassy hip-swaying gait, looking forward with a confident smirk. In its hands, it proudly holds up <Subject 4> high above its head, showing the bold printed text \"minimax牛逼\". Strutting on the left, <Subject 2> keeps pace with high-energy steps, giving a playful wink and holding up a peace sign toward the imaginary audience. On the right, <Subject 3> waddles rhythmically with comical hip sways, waving its thin arms in a glamorous fashion. Bright, colorful stage lights sweep over them, casting dynamic reflections on the catwalk as they march confidently forward until the video ends at 00:07.000.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nLoud cheering, camera shutter clicks, and enthusiastic applause from an unseen crowd echo in a large hall.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nAn upbeat, fast-tempo electronic house track with a heavy, driving bassline and glamorous synth melodies plays throughout the video.",
